00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.876 line:92%
which premieres on Apple TV+

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
with the first two episode
this Friday.

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:13.046 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's take a look.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.581 size:88% position:44% line:92%
[ Up-tempo music plays ]

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Door bursts open ]
-[ Gasps ]

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:20.286 line:92%
